# {{.Project}} — generated LiveKit Agents project

Generated by `unmute compile` (livekit driver). Speech-to-text and text-to-speech
route through the SLNG Execution Layer (`livekit-plugins-slng`); reasoning and
turn detection run on LiveKit Inference. Entry agent: `{{.EntryClass}}`.

## Run

```
uv sync                       # or: pip install -e .
cp .env.example .env.local    # then fill in the values (LiveKit Cloud + SLNG_API_KEY)
python agent.py dev
```

Do not edit this project by hand — it is regenerated from the agent spec. Change
the spec and recompile.
